      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Unsure about this, since it would result in PC and Quest having completely different keyboards and in turn lose feature parity. \nNot a bad idea by all means, but I think it would just lead to problems development wise.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
